>**Increases Nation's {p:Resources|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Resources}.**
=2 Walkthrough
* Gain your mission from {n:Emhi Tchaoryo}.
* Go to (F-9) in {z:Windurst Waters (S)} and talk to the {p:Quartermaster|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Quartermaster_(Windurst)} NPC.
* The Quartermaster will ask you for an item(s).
** The item(s) is random and can be bought from the AH or obtained from either {p:Harvesting}, {p:Mining}, {p:Logging} or even dropped off different Mobs.
* Trade the item(s) to the {p:Quartermaster (Windurst)|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Quartermaster_(Windurst)} (F-9).
* Report back to {n:Emhi Tchaoryo} to complete the mission.

=2 Possible Requests
* {i:Dhalmel Hair|Dhalmel Hair|2539} x1
* {i:Rafflesia Petal|Rafflesia Petal|2514} x1
* {i:Rafflesia Vine|Rafflesia Vine|2513} x1
* {i:Yagudo Osode|Yagudo Osode|2519} x1
* {i:Yagudo Kote|Yagudo Kote|2520} x1
* {i:Lynx Hide|Lynx Hide|2512} x1
* {i:Lynx Meat|Lynx Meat|5667} x1
* {i:Gnat Wing|Gnat Wing|2522} x2

=2 Notes
* You will obtain a key item: {p:Supply Order|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Supply_Order} when you obtain the item requested by {p:Harvesting}, {p:Mining}, {p:Logging}, or a monster. If not, you will not receive the key item.
* Key item: {p:Supply Order|https://ffxiclopedia.fandom.com/wiki/Supply_Order} is not needed to complete the Ops.
* The requested item can only be harvested in the past, however you can buy them from the {z:Auction House}. Also, the {z:West Sarutabaruta (S)} Harvesting Points are __not__ always in the same positions as they are in the present.

=2 Objective
\**Unit Requirement:** 1 member
